# Mission Log

**Location:** Tokyo
**Date:** October 31, 2018

The situation deteriorated faster than expected.

The barriers prevented ordinary communication and isolated the area almost immediately.

Several reports mentioned the same individual.

Suguru Geto.

That name caused considerable confusion.

Geto is dead.

There should be no reason for anyone to report seeing him in Shibuya.

Yet the descriptions were consistent.

Same face.

Same hair.

Same scars.

Same mannerisms.

At first I assumed it was a mistake.

Then I saw him myself.

It was not a mistake.

I recognized the body immediately.

I did not recognize the person inside it.
